		{"id":"08bf9ac90ed80637","type":"text","text":"$$\ny=e^{-\\int P(x)\\,dx}\\left(\\int Q(x)e^{\\int P(x)\\,dx}\\,dx + C\\right)\n$$","x":3940,"y":80,"width":426,"height":103},
